# Four bags of readings; the second and fourth are empty. A fold with a registered identity
# answers an empty bag with that identity; the extrema have none, so those rows have no answer
# at all and drop — the same law a predicate with no matches obeys.
n 4
col bag bool 1 1 1 1
col total int -1 -1 -1 -1
col peak int -1 -1 -1 -1
srel readings 3 5 | | 2 4 9 |
ja 袋 bag
ja 合計 total
ja 頂点 peak
ja 測定 readings
